              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 17:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana abanakashi bakwa Selofeadi umwana mwaume wakwa Eferi, umwana mwaume wakwa Gileadi, umwana mwaume wakwa Makiri, umwana mwaume wakwa Manase, bali ba mu mikowa yakwa Manase umwana mwaume wakwa Yosefu. Amashina ya bana abanakashi bali ni Mala, Noa, Hogila, Milika na Tirisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baya iminina pantanshi yakwa Mose, Eleasa shimapepo na ku ntungulushi na ku lukuta lonse ku mwinshi we Tenti Lyakukumaninamo, basosa nokuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Batata bafwilile mu matololo, tabashilepo abana abaume nakalya. Tabali mwibumba lyakwa Kora lilya lyasangukile Yawe, lelo bafwililefye pa mulandu wa bubifi bacitile abene beka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bushe ico batata tabakwetepo abana abaume, eco ishina lingalobela mu lupwa lwabo? Tupeniko na ifwe icuma ukufuma pafyo mwapeela bamunyina batata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose ena epakutwala umulandu wabo kuli Yawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elyo Yawe asosa kuli Mose ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.36.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imp 36:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ifilesosa bamwana Selofeadi abanakashi fyacine. Ufwile ukushininkisha ukuti wabapeela icuma nge ca cishilano cabo, ngefi fine wapeela bamunyina kwa shibo. Kabili nabo ubapeele icuma ica cishilano cakwa shibo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili landa ku bena Israeli ukuti, ‘Umuntu umo nga afwa takwetepo umwana umwaume, umwana wakwe umwanakashi kuti abuula icuma ca cishilano cakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga takwete umwana umwanakashi, ninshi peeleni icuma ca cishilano kuli bamunyina abaume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga takwete bamunyina abaume, ninshi peeleni icuma ca cishilano kuli bamunyina abaume abakwa wishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga wishi nao takwete bamunyina abaume, peeleni icuma ca cishilano kuli umo uwa mu lupwa, mu mukowa umo wine, nge cuma cakwe. Ili e funde lya bena Israeli ne cipope icakulakonkwa, ngefyo Yawe akonkomeshe Mose.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
