              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amaf 3:23-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.48+DEU.32.49+DEU.32.50+DEU.32.51+DEU.32.52"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "32:48-52",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe aebele Mose ati, “Kabiye pa mulu wa lupili lwa Abarimu, umone icalo ico mpeele abena Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panuma yakucimona, na iwe wine uli nokuya lala ukwalala ifikolwe fyobe pamo nga munonko Aroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pantu ilyo ulukuta lwansangukile pa menshi mu matololo ya Sini, imwe bonse babili mwakene ukubeela ifyo namukonkomeshe ngo wamushilo pa menso yabo.” (Aya yali menshi ya ku Meriba Kadeshi mu matololo ya ku Sini).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
