              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.34.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 34:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.9.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mateo 9:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.6.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mako 6:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alebatangilila pakuya na pakubweluluka, umo uwakuti alebatungulula pakuya no kubabwesha, pakuti ulukuta lwa bantu bakwa Yawe lwiba nge mpaanga ishabula kacema.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.24.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ukuf 24:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yawe aeba Mose ati, “Buula Yoshua umwana mwaume uwakwa Nuni, umuntu uwabamo Umupashi, umutambalikilepo ukuboko kobe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo uye mwiminika pantanshi yakwa Eleasa shimapepo no lukuta lonse, elyo umupeelele imilimo yobe pa menso yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umupeele amaka yobe yamo pakuti ulukuta lonse ulwa bena Israeli lulemubeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.28.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ukuf 28:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.14.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 14:41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.28.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili akalaiminina ku cinso cakwa Eleasa shimapepo, uuli no kwipusha ifya bupingushi mukubomfya Urimu pa cinso cakwa Yawe. Mu kukonkomesha kwakwe, ena no lukuta lonse ulwa bena Israeli bali nokufuma, kabili mu kukonkomesha kwakwe bakabweluluka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose nao acita ngefyo Yawe amukonkomeshe. Abuula Yoshua amwimika pantanshi yakwa Eleasa shimapepo no lukuta lonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.31.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amaf 31:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo amutambalikilapo amaboko yakwe no kumupeela imilimo yakwe pamo ngefyo Yawe aebele Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.23"
            ]
          }
        }
